# Data Engineering Journey 🚀

A collection of projects and practice code built during my 
2-month Data Engineering learning journey.

## About Me
- 2nd Year Computer Science Student
- Learning Data Engineering from scratch
- Goal: Land a DE internship

## Tech Stack Learned
- **Languages:** Python, SQL
- **Libraries:** Pandas, requests, psycopg2
- **Tools:** Apache Airflow, dbt, Snowflake
- **Cloud:** AWS (S3, Glue, Redshift, Athena)
- **Databases:** PostgreSQL, Snowflake

## Projects
### Project 3 — COVID-19 Data Lake (AWS)
- Fetches live COVID data from REST API
- Stores raw data in AWS S3
- Processes with AWS Glue
- Queries with Athena
- Tech: Python, Airflow, AWS S3, Glue, Redshift

### Project 2 — E-Commerce ETL Pipeline
- Batch ETL pipeline with Apache Airflow
- Transforms data using dbt models
- Loads to Snowflake data warehouse
- Tech: Python, Airflow, dbt, Snowflake

### Project 1 — Real-Time Stock Pipeline
- Real-time streaming with Apache Kafka
- Processes with PySpark Streaming
- Visualizes with Grafana
- Tech: Kafka, PySpark, AWS S3, Grafana

## Practice Code
- **covid_pipeline.py** — Mini COVID data pipeline
  - Fetches data from disease.sh API
  - Cleans with Pandas
  - Analyzes top countries
  - Saves to CSV and JSON

